    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CareGuide – Medical Translator (Form)\nA web form: the user pastes medical text or uploads a PDF report. The text is split into chunks, translated into Modern Standard Arabic, then checked by a second proofreading pass and shown on the completion page.\n\n**Setup:** add an OpenRouter credential, publish the workflow and share the form's Production URL. It uses the OpenRouter free router, which has a daily request limit.\n\nTranslation only: no medical advice.",
